{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"1a3de548-13bd-4e7a-8f5b-3e7dfaa968b9","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I am probing the connection to `91.107.164.78:8080` to determine the service type and availability.\nI'm waiting for the probe command to finish testing the connection.\n### Challenge Summary: **2048** (`Web`)\n\n- **CTF**: ASIS CTF Quals 2026\n- **Category**: Web\n- **Challenge ID**: `105` (29 pts · 289 solves)\n- **Path**: [`/home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048)\n- **Status**: :white_check_mark: Solved\n\n---\n\n### Root Cause \u0026 Vulnerability Analysis\n\n1. **Decoy Application**:\n   The visible web interface on port 8080 presents a client-side JavaScript 2048 game as a decoy. Behind the scenes, the endpoint exposes an **Apache Tomcat** instance configured with **Apache Tribes** clustering enabled.\n\n2. **Fail-Open EncryptInterceptor ([CVE-2026-34486](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-34486))**:\n   - The cluster channel uses `org.apache.catalina.tribes.interceptors.EncryptInterceptor` to encrypt inter-node cluster messages.\n   - Due to a refactoring regression, the `super.messageReceived(msg)` invocation was placed outside the `try-catch` block handling decryption in `EncryptInterceptor.messageReceived()`.\n   - When an unencrypted or corrupted cluster frame is received, decryption throws an exception which is caught and logged, but execution proceeds to call `super.messageReceived(msg)` with the **raw, unencrypted message bytes**.\n\n3. **Sink (Unsafe Deserialization)**:\n   - Downstream interceptors forward the raw bytes to `XByteBuffer.deserialize()`, which passes the byte stream directly into Java's `ObjectInputStream.readObject()` without type filtering.\n   - An unauthenticated attacker can transmit a serialized Java gadget chain wrapped in a Tribes frame to achieve Remote Code Execution (RCE) on the server.\n\n---\n\n### Recovered Flag\n\n```text\nASIS{t0McAT_was_Th3_KEY}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Workspace Artifacts \u0026 Verification\n\n- **Solver**: [`solver/solve.py`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/solver/solve.py) (implements Tribes frame generation and verified flag resolution)\n- **Flags**:\n  - [`solver/flag.txt`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/solver/flag.txt)\n  - [`flag.txt`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/flag.txt)\n- **Technical Probe**: [`script/exploit_probe.py`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/script/exploit_probe.py)\n- **Verification Report**: [`script/worker-report.json`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/script/worker-report.json)\n- **Challenge Spec**: [`challenge/README.md`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/challenge/README.md)\n- **Full Writeup**: [`writeup/README.md`](file:///home/light/Workspace/CTF/ASIS_CTF_2026/Web/2048/writeup/README.md)\n","duration_seconds":203.656171042,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":372711,"output_tokens":15044,"thinking_tokens":6729,"cache_read_tokens":1617051,"total_tokens":387755}}}
